          type: "challenge",
          content: `# TDD Workflow

## 📚 Learn: Red-Green-Refactor cycle, test-first design

## 🎯 Challenge: Build Shopping Cart using TDD

### Requirements:
1. Add items to cart (with quantity)
2. Remove items from cart
3. Update item quantity
4. Calculate cart total
5. Apply discount code "SAVE10" (10% off)
6. Clear cart

### TDD Steps:
RED: Write test for smallest behavior (add item)
GREEN: Write minimum code to pass
REFACTOR: Clean up code, keep tests green
Repeat for each behavior

### Bonus: Thread-safe cart, validation (no negative qty), max 100 items`,
          codeTemplate: "// TODO: Implement Shopping Cart using TDD\n// Step 1 (RED): Write test for addItem\n// Step 2 (GREEN): Implement addItem\n// Step 3 (REFACTOR): Clean up\n// Repeat for each behavior",
          solution: `public class ShoppingCart {
    private final ConcurrentHashMap<Long, CartItem> items = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();

    public void addItem(Long id, String name, BigDecimal price, int qty) {
        if (qty <= 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException("Qty must be positive");
        if (items.size() >= 100) throw new IllegalStateException("Cart limit");
        items.merge(id, new CartItem(id, name, price, qty), (e, i) -> new CartItem(id, name, price, e.quantity() + qty));
    }

    public void removeItem(Long id) {
        if (items.remove(id) == null) throw new NoSuchElementException("Not found");
    }

    public BigDecimal getTotal(String code) {
        BigDecimal subtotal = items.values().stream()
            .map(i -> i.unitPrice().multiply(BigDecimal.valueOf(i.quantity())))
            .reduce(BigDecimal.ZERO, BigDecimal::add);
        BigDecimal discount = "SAVE10".equals(code) ? subtotal.multiply(BigDecimal.valueOf(0.1)) : BigDecimal.ZERO;
        return subtotal.subtract(discount).max(BigDecimal.ZERO);
    }

    public int getItemCount() {
        return items.values().stream().mapToInt(CartItem::quantity).sum();
    }

    public void clear() { items.clear(); }
}

// TDD Tests
class ShoppingCartTest {
    private ShoppingCart cart;
    @BeforeEach void setUp() { cart = new ShoppingCart(); }

    @Test void testAddItem_CountIncreases() {
        cart.addItem(1L, "Laptop", BigDecimal.valueOf(999), 1);
        assertThat(cart.getItemCount()).isEqualTo(1);
    }

    @Test void testAddItem_Duplicate_MergesQuantity() {
        cart.addItem(1L, "Laptop", BigDecimal.valueOf(999), 1);
        cart.addItem(1L, "Laptop", BigDecimal.valueOf(999), 2);
        assertThat(cart.getItemCount()).isEqualTo(3);
    }

    @Test void testAddItem_NegativeQty_Throws() {
        assertThatThrownBy(() -> cart.addItem(1L, "T", BigDecimal.ONE, -1))
            .isInstanceOf(IllegalArgumentException.class);
    }

    @Test void testRemoveItem_NonExistent_Throws() {
        assertThatThrownBy(() -> cart.removeItem(999L))
            .isInstanceOf(NoSuchElementException.class);
    }

    @Test void testGetTotal_WithDiscount() {
        cart.addItem(1L, "Laptop", BigDecimal.valueOf(1000), 1);
        assertThat(cart.getTotal("SAVE10")).isEqualByComparingTo("900");
    }

    @Test void testGetTotal_InvalidDiscount() {
        cart.addItem(1L, "Laptop", BigDecimal.valueOf(1000), 1);
        assertThat(cart.getTotal("INVALID")).isEqualByComparingTo("1000");
    }

    @Test void testClear_EmptiesCart() {
        cart.addItem(1L, "Laptop", BigDecimal.valueOf(999), 1);
        cart.clear();
        assertThat(cart.getItemCount()).isEqualTo(0);
    }
}`,
